Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 19:03:10 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Fix black-box failures: upload formats, limit message, quiz
 answer guards, SPI label

- Learning Hub accepts the documented PDF/DOCX/DOC/TXT/CSV types (UPL-03, UPL-05)
- "Matched previous content" notice stays visible briefly before the next stage (UPL-13)
- "File too large" message states the configured limit, not a fixed 10 MB (ADM-09)
- Quiz: empty fill-in / half-sorted answers can't be submitted, dots can't skip
  ahead (QZ-13); answer is filed under the question it was submitted for (QZ-02);
  revisited True/False no longer painted red (QZ-03)
- Dashboard shows a "Provisional" note while SPI rests on fewer than 3 quizzes (ANL-04)
- Unit tests for the limit wording and the SPI formula

